    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position: [the Tuesday/Thursday early-open-for-commuters tradeoff](narr:Position_TuesdayThursdayHoursTradeoff), where [opening at eight so commuters can return books on the way in](narr:Position_TuesdayThursdayHoursTradeoff) is paired with [closing an hour earlier those days to keep staffing flat](narr:Position_TuesdayThursdayHoursTradeoff). The frame asks what each hours change is meant to serve and what it trades off; this position answers with one concrete instance, voiced by [Moira](narr:Position_TuesdayThursdayHoursTradeoff) and [Teo](narr:Position_TuesdayThursdayHoursTradeoff) together.""" ;
